            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Binu nibyo biragiro, kandi nibyo ebigambo, MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu ebi yandagiire kubeegesa, nukwo mubihondere omunsi ei murukwambuka kulya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibigamba biti: otemuga ekitinisa MUKAMA Ruhanga wawe, iwe na mutabani wawe na mwijukuru wawe, obu mulikwata ebiragiro bye n'ebigambo bye binu byona ebi ndukubaragira, obwomeezi bwanyu bwona, nubwo mulihangaara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhunde amatu, inywe Abaisirairi, kandi muteho omutima kubikwata nukwo mutunge omugisa, mukanye muno omunsi ijwire erukugera amata n'obwoki, MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baisenkuru inywe nkooku yabanihiize.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
